<item>
<title>Upcoming SDK minimum requirements</title>
<link>https://developer.apple.com/news/?id=test0008</link>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Starting April 28, 2026, uploads to App Store Connect need:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iOS and iPadOS apps must be built with the iOS 26 &amp;amp; iPadOS 26 SDK or later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;tvOS apps must be built with the tvOS 26 SDK or later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;visionOS apps must be built with the visionOS 26 SDK or later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;watchOS apps must be built with the watchOS 26 SDK or later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://developer.apple.com/app-store/submitting/"&gt;More info&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Feb 2026 06:00:30 PST</pubDate>
</item>
